{"title": "Cockroach Janta Party to remain pressure group, not enter polls", "summary": "The Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) has announced it will not enter electoral politics in the immediate future. Instead, the party stated it will operate as a pressure group. Abhijeet Dipke confirmed the CJP's decision to remain a pressure group for now. The party's stance focuses on reclaiming insults through political action rather than direct electoral participation.", "summary_points": ["The Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) will not enter electoral politics immediately.", "The CJP will operate as a pressure group.", "Abhijeet Dipke confirmed the party's decision to remain a pressure group.", "The party's political strategy involves reclaiming insults."], "title_hi": "कॉकक्रोच जनता पार्टी दबाव समूह बनी रहेगी, चुनाव में प्रवेश नहीं करेगी", "summary_hi": "कॉकक्रोच जनता पार्टी (CJP) ने घोषणा की है कि वह तत्काल भविष्य में चुनावी राजनीति में प्रवेश नहीं करेगी। इसके बजाय, पार्टी ने कहा कि वह एक दबाव समूह के रूप में काम करेगी। अभिजीत दीपके ने CJP के फिलहाल दबाव समूह बने रहने के फैसले की पुष्टि की। पार्टी का रुख सीधे चुनावी भागीदारी के बजाय राजनीतिक कार्रवाई के माध्यम से अपमान का बदला लेने पर केंद्रित है।", "summary_points_hi": ["कॉकक्रोच जनता पार्टी (CJP) तत्काल चुनावी राजनीति में प्रवेश नहीं करेगी।", "CJP एक दबाव समूह के रूप में काम करेगी।", "अभिजीत दीपके ने पार्टी के दबाव समूह बने रहने के फैसले की पुष्टि की।", "पार्टी की राजनीतिक रणनीति में अपमान का बदला लेना शामिल है।"], "framing": {"left": ["Reported the Cockroach Janta Party's decision to remain a pressure group.", "Stated Abhijeet Dipke confirmed the CJP will operate as a pressure group for now.", "Mentioned the party's focus on reclaiming insults."], "center": ["Reported the CJP's decision to rule out immediate entry into electoral politics.", "Stated the CJP will remain a 'pressure group'.", "Highlighted the politics of reclaiming insults as a party theme."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["कॉकक्रोच जनता पार्टी के दबाव समूह बने रहने के फैसले की सूचना दी।", "बताया कि अभिजीत दीपके ने पुष्टि की कि CJP फिलहाल एक दबाव समूह के रूप में काम करेगी।", "पार्टी के अपमान का बदला लेने पर ध्यान केंद्रित करने का उल्लेख किया।"], "center": ["CJP के चुनावी राजनीति में तत्काल प्रवेश को खारिज करने के फैसले की सूचना दी।", "बताया कि CJP एक 'दबाव समूह' बनी रहेगी।", "पार्टी के एक विषय के रूप में अपमान का बदला लेने की राजनीति पर प्रकाश डाला।"]}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://www.livemint.com/lm-img/img/2026/08/06/1600x900/maxresdefault_1786019134207_1786019138280_8ba9962d-2532-4506-9ce1-7c033af988ed.jpg", "sources": [{"source": "The Quint", "owner": "The Quint", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "The Cockroach Janta Party and the Politics of Reclaiming Insults"}, {"source": "The Telegraph (India)", "owner": "The Telegraph (India)", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Cockroach Janta Party rules out immediate entry into electoral politics"}, {"source": "Scroll.in", "owner": "Scroll.in", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "Cockroach Janta Party to operate as pressure group for now, says Abhijeet Dipke"}, {"source": "Deccan Herald", "owner": "Deccan Herald", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxOa1M1NVBkc1VkVUpVNDdGVEhFeGtZVmI3SWtXOGRiVjUxVHlNTFlnYnhZbl9ENW9zWG9RSWl0ZTRCTXNJS2FVdXJfOXZEMTNKaWo4SGpGU1Bmb045Ykp2TFBFaVRBdjllekhEODUtZU5mbHpFSDdpSXZycDlNNjU1aGhWbW9XNmJxc0hBS2R4M1UzWTdhc0lzQkdZN19TdG5FZXpTUkE4bmNOMVRQYVgtQ3Bvd2FrT2pWQXJFV3VGSnNsZw?oc=5", "headline": "CJP rules out electoral politics, says it will remain a ‘pressure group’"}, {"source": "Hindustan Times", "owner": "HT Media", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "headline": "CJP to act as a 'pressure group': Abhijeet Dipke shifts focus to E20 after NEET protest | India News"}, {"sou